# client/configs/ai-apks.list
# Minimal container runtime (Docker) + Bun (for DeepSeek Harness) needed
# to run the on-demand Ollama GPU container + dsh. These are LAZY-LOADED:
# the .apk files are baked into the ISO's on-disk repository so ai-extra.sh
# can install them OFFLINE on demand, but they are NOT written to
# /etc/apk/world - they must never extract into the 4G tmpfs root at boot.
#
# Source of truth: /etc/ai-apks.list (copied verbatim by build pipelines).
docker
docker-cli
docker-cli-buildx
docker-cli-compose
bun